gzrt
------------------------------------------
Recover data from a corrupted gzip file

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.10-1
  zlib0-1.3.2-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.7-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  make-4.4.1-2
  zlib-devel-1.3.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/arenn/gzrt

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/arenn/gzrt/archive/refs/tags/v0.9.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack gzrt-0.9.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./gzrt-0.9.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/gzrt-0.9.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/gzrt-0.9.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(gzrt)
  /usr/bin/gzrecover.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/gzrt.README
  /usr/share/doc/gzrt/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/gzrt/README
  /usr/share/man/man1/gzrecover.1.gz

------------------

